## 🔍 Debugging Tests

### Running Specific Tests
```bash
# Run single test file
pnpm test kafka-consumer.service.spec.ts

# Run tests matching pattern
pnpm test --testNamePattern="should handle success"

# Run in watch mode
pnpm test --watch

# Run with coverage
pnpm test --coverage
```

### Debugging in VSCode
1. Set breakpoint in test file
2. Open "Run and Debug" panel
3. Select "Jest Current File"
4. Press F5 to start debugging

